# Alterac Mountains (Horde) - Recipes & Patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes and patterns whose SOURCE is physically in Alterac Mountains
# for a Horde character, verified against the local Forever game data
# (questie-forever item vendor and drop tables). Twenty are vendor-sold by
# in-zone vendors Horde characters can buy (Zixil, Rizz Loosebolt, Brokin,
# Zan Shivsproket and Smudge Thunderwood, all neutral; Norvin Alderman,
# neutral; Christoph Jeffcoat, Mallen Swain and Derak Nightfall, all Horde);
# four are mob drops from single in-zone families (two with adjacent-zone
# members, the established genuinely-Alterac bar). Everything else
# Alterac-dropping is a generic multi-zone world drop (Elwynn rule, argued
# per case in the inventory), the 8 Archmage Alvareaux recipes are
# Alliance-vendor exclusive, quest records carry no reward data so no
# quest-reward recipe ships (see docs/alterac-horde-companions-inventory.md
# and docs/companion-unverified.md). Trainer-taught staples are excluded:
# Polestars own profession guides cover those. Each step is gated to its
# profession and every goal is optional; other characters skip it cleanly.
# Fishing has no Alterac source for Horde, so that is stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/alterac-horde-recipes
title Alterac Mountains (Horde) - Recipes & Patterns
levels 20-45
zone Alterac Mountains
faction Horde
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords alterac, horde, recipes, patterns, companions
coords live
version 1

step Zixil - bag, boots, shoulders, cables and regret

  zone map 1416

  when skill Tailoring 1

  tip Zixil (53.60, 98.70), Merchant Supreme, sells the recipes; the shop is neutral, so Horde characters can buy.
  buy 5772 "Pattern: Red Woolen Bag" npc 3537 optional
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

  when skill Enchanting 1

  buy 6377 "Formula: Enchant Boots - Minor Agility" npc 3537 optional
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  buy 7362 "Pattern: Earthen Leather Shoulders" npc 3537 optional
  note The vendor is the SOLE seller anywhere; stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

  when skill Engineering 1

  buy 7561 "Schematic: Goblin Jumper Cables" npc 3537 optional
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

  when skill Alchemy 1

  buy 210709 "Recipe: Elixir of Coalesced Regret" npc 3537 optional
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

