step Skeletal flayer - gift of Arthas (Alchemy)

  zone map 1416

  when skill Alchemy 1

  goto 85.80,29.50
  kill 1783 optional -- Skeletal Flayer, in the east
  collect 9296 "Recipe: Gift of Arthas" optional
  note The Skeletal Flayer (level 50) is the sole 1416 dropper in the data (one off-zone Ghoul shares the drop); come back well above the 20-45 band for it. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step No Alterac source - Fishing
  note Fishing has no recipe source physically in Alterac Mountains for Horde in the data - no vendor sells them here and no in-zone mob drops them - so this guide carries nothing for it. Polestars own profession guides cover trainer-taught staples.

